keywords:
  - TESS
  - exoplanets
  - transit search
  - planet candidates
  - CTOI
abstract: >-
  Transit candidates from a blind search of TESS 2-minute SPOC light curves with FBLS, a
  GPU detector (FBLS, Family Box Least Squares): per-duration detrending
  families, correlated-noise scaling of the amplitude statistic, trapezoidal shapes, a
  multi-pass search with masking, a single-event scan and a joint planet/binary/noise
  evidence at every peak. Every signal went through automated vetting (odd/even, secondary
  eclipse, shape, duration against stellar density, centroid, crowding and the Robovetter
  flux tests) and a difference-image pixel test. Each version is the cumulative catalog to
  its date: ctoi.csv (ExoFOP CTOI rows), candidates.csv (every vetted signal), figures.zip
  (one folder of panel data per CTOI signal) and ReadMe.txt (column definitions). The search
  and vetting code is at the repository.
